1
00:04:02,727 --> 00:04:08,727
They're back to raise a little terror.

2
00:08:05,454 --> 00:08:11,454
Hotel Transylvania 2 is a animation, comedy, family
film directed by Genndy Tartakovsky.

3
00:12:08,181 --> 00:12:14,181
When the old-old-old-fashioned vampire Vlad arrives at the hotel for an impromptu family get-together,
Hotel Transylvania is in for a collision of supernatural old-school and modern day cool.

4
00:16:10,909 --> 00:16:16,909
Dracula (voice), played by Adam Sandler.

5
00:20:13,636 --> 00:20:19,636
Johnny Loughran (voice), played by Andy Samberg.

6
00:24:16,363 --> 00:24:22,363
Mavis Dracula (voice), played by Selena Gomez.

7
00:28:19,090 --> 00:28:25,090
Frankenstein (voice), played by Kevin James.

8
00:32:21,818 --> 00:32:27,818
Wayne (voice), played by Steve Buscemi.

9
00:36:24,545 --> 00:36:30,545
Griffin (voice), played by David Spade.

10
00:40:27,272 --> 00:40:33,272
Hotel Transylvania 2 is a 2015 American animated monster comedy film directed by
Genndy Tartakovsky and written by Robert Smigel and Adam Sandler.

11
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:36,000
Produced by Columbia Pictures and Sony Pictures Animation, it is the second installment in
the Hotel Transylvania franchise and the sequel to Hotel Transylvania (2012).

12
00:48:32,727 --> 00:48:38,727
Sandler, Andy Samberg, Selena Gomez, Kevin James, David Spade, Steve Buscemi, Molly Shannon and Fran Drescher
reprise their roles from the first film, with Keegan-Michael Key and Mel Brooks joining the cast.

13
00:52:35,454 --> 00:52:41,454
The film takes place several years after the events of the first film.

14
00:56:38,181 --> 00:56:44,181
Mavis and Johnny have a young son named Dennis, whose lack of any vampire abilities
worries both Mavis and his maternal grandfather Dracula for differing reasons.

15
01:00:40,909 --> 01:00:46,909
When Mavis and Johnny travel to Johnny's hometown in Santa Cruz, California, Drac calls
his friends to help him make Dennis a vampire, much to Mavis's dismay.

16
01:04:43,636 --> 01:04:49,636
Hotel Transylvania 2 was released theatrically on
September 25, 2015, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

17
01:08:46,363 --> 01:08:52,363
The film received mixed reviews and grossed $474
million worldwide on an $80 million budget.

18
01:12:49,090 --> 01:12:55,090
It won a Kids' Choice Award for Favorite Animated Movie.

19
01:16:51,818 --> 01:16:57,818
A further sequel, Hotel Transylvania 3: Summer Vacation, was released in 2018.

20
01:20:54,545 --> 01:21:00,545
The film explores themes of hotel, witch, skeleton, magic, transylvania.

21
01:24:57,272 --> 01:25:03,272
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
